==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[peg]], driven into the [[ground]], to hold a [[rope]] that supports a [[tent]].
#: ''Upon arrival at the campsite, they discovered that they had forgotten the '''tent pegs'''; they had to use rocks and logs to tether the tent instead.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|peg driven into ground to support tent}} [[spike]], [[stake]]

